# {{lb|sh|Serbia|Bosnia}} [[cross]], [[crucifix]] (also figuratively)

====Usage notes====
This word, in religious context, is used mainly by Orthodox Christians, and consequently generally more common among Serbs than Croats. Catholics (and Croats generally) tend to prefer the term {{m|sh|кри̑ж}}.

